vcdec (libvcdec), linked into FFmpeg's h264_vchiq decoder, Reel and
ReelEGL, is from ReelHWAccel: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-reelhwaccel

ReelHWAccel is a new implementation. It drives the Raspberry Pi's
VideoCore through the VCHIQ module in RISC OS's ROM, with its own MMAL
client, written using Linux's VCHIQ MMAL driver (vchiq-mmal, GPL-2.0) as
a reference. No code was copied from it.

It is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 (or
later), the same version as the Linux driver it used as a reference. The
licence's text is GPLv2 in this directory; the source is at the address
above.
